    route:`15-minute drive north to <b>Punta Prosciutto</b>. Be on the sand by <b>09:00</b> to secure parking and a shaded lido spot. Head back by 13:00 for nap time. Evening <i>passeggiata</i> around Porto Cesareo's marina.`,
